  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57a8e05a8a1d4451e9081ab70ab1f576, type: 3}
  itemDescription: 'Advanced Manufacturing Technologies Institute  This institute
    drives innovation in advanced manufacturing and Industry 4.0 technologies. Its
    mission includes automation, robotics, additive manufacturing (3D printing),
    and smart factory systems. Key focus areas: developing industrial robots and
    control systems for local manufacturing, implementing IoT and AI for predictive
    maintenance in factories, advancing 3D printing of metals and polymers for rapid
    prototyping and production, and supporting SMEs in adopting advanced processes.
    The institute aims to increase productivity, quality, and flexibility of Saudi
    manufacturing, helping industries transition to high-tech, knowledge-based production
    with a skilled workforce'
